                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have two issue with Zaba The Frog:\n\n- the camera is very not friendly with player, I mean the only way to discover any kind of traps is only when you fall into them, it's nearly impossible to learn about them any other way.\n\n- there is definitely something wrong with either physics or controls, I don't know. My frog never lands where I want it to, and doing any maneuvers that would mean turning the screen into a full circle give you really bad results.\n\nSadly, these problems made my experience with the game not fun at all and I can't recommend this game to anyone.",
